# Patterns are root-anchored (leading /): unanchored names also match nested
# folders such as src/lib/supabase and public/img.
# Keep CLI deployments to the minimum needed to build the app (HKUST ITSO:
# no credentials or High-Risk evidence outside controlled storage).
.env*
!.env.example
/.omo
/.claude
/.codegraph
/.github
/docs
/doc
/prompt
/img
/scripts
/supabase
/coverage
*.pem
*.log
/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
